WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.893
This query labels different phone states A true SQL
NULL is labeled

00:00:05.919 --> 00:00:12.632
NULL A trimmed empty string is labeled blank
All-zero

00:00:12.659 --> 00:00:18.747
or all-nine digit patterns are labeled sentinel for
this teaching example Everything

00:00:18.773 --> 00:00:24.580
else is treated as a candidate value This
classification step is useful

00:00:24.607 --> 00:00:27.725
before deciding whether any states should be
normalized together
